--- /dev/null
+++ b/doc/whatsnew/fragments/7229.bugfix
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+Fixes regular expressions containing commas (e.g. quantifiers like ``{1,3}``)
+being split and mangled when given to ``regexp_csv`` options such as
+``bad-names-rgxs``, which caused a crash.
+
+Closes #7229
